# Permissions the emissions module may declare, one per line. CI fails on anything else.
# Every one of these is already in the app (Explore, Surroundings); Emissions adds none to the APK.
# Wi-Fi on/off and Wi-Fi scanning on/off; the bag test's connected-network check. Normal permissions, no prompt.
android.permission.ACCESS_WIFI_STATE
android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE
# Mobile data on/off (TelephonyManager.isDataEnabled). Normal permission, no prompt, no identifiers.
android.permission.READ_BASIC_PHONE_STATE
# Faraday bag test only, asked for when the user starts it: count Bluetooth devices heard and Wi-Fi networks seen
# outside and inside the bag (neverForLocation, counts only, nothing stored).
android.permission.BLUETOOTH_SCAN
android.permission.NEARBY_WIFI_DEVICES
# The bag test's buzz when listening starts and ends, with the phone in the bag. Normal permission, no prompt.
android.permission.VIBRATE
